OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't remember my life without
OL,4,Aarthritis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who "doesn't remember" life
OL,7,Fwithout arthritis says she hopes new
OL,8,Fresearch leads to a cure for the
OL,9,Fcondition.
OL,11,FAnnabelle, 17, from Bristol, has spent
OL,12,Fthe past ten years undergoing treatment
OL,13,Ffor juvenile idiopathic arthritis
OL,14,F(JIA), including painful fortnightly
OL,15,Finjections to keep the disease under
OL,16,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
