OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1793687247
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't remember my life without
OL,4,Aarthritis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol Royal Hospital for Children has
OL,7,Fjoined an international effort to
OL,8,Fdevelop new treatments for the
OL,9,Fcondition, which causes swollen and
OL,10,Fstiff joints and is as common as type 1
OL,11,Fdiabetes in young children, according
OL,12,Fto the NHS.
OL,14,F"If there's a cure that would be very
OL,15,Fgood because I'm not sure I'll ever get
OL,16,Foff my medication," said Annabelle.
